#: properties.py:437
msgid "The top-left grid coordinate (horizontal) of this control's occupied area; larger values are further right. Numbers may be skipped to leave gaps. Actual cell footprint depends on the control style (see grid_layout.py)"
msgstr "该控件占用区域左上角的网格坐标（水平）；数值越大越靠右。可以跳过某些数字以留出空隙。实际占用的单元格取决于控件样式（见 grid_layout.py）"

#: properties.py:443
msgid "The top-left grid coordinate (vertical) of this control's occupied area; larger values are further down. Actual cell footprint depends on the control style (see grid_layout.py)"
msgstr "该控件占用区域左上角的网格坐标（垂直）；数值越大越靠下。实际占用的单元格取决于控件样式（见 grid_layout.py）"

