#: __init__.py:104
msgid "When off, the slider list only shows sliders belonging to the group currently selected in the Groups list; when on, sliders from every group are shown"
msgstr "关闭时，滑块列表仅显示“组”列表中当前选中组内的滑块；开启时显示所有组的滑块"

#: properties.py:216
msgid "When off, this group's Frame won't generate a visible rectangular outline, but the Frame object itself is still created (to hold layout and bindings); sliders inside are unaffected"
msgstr "关闭时，该组的框架不会生成可见的矩形轮廓，但框架物体本身仍会创建（用于承载布局和绑定）；其中的滑块不受影响"

#: properties.py:208
msgid "When the bound object is an Armature, specifies which bone to follow; leave empty to follow the object's own origin"
msgstr "当绑定对象为骨架时，指定要跟随哪根骨骼；留空则跟随物体自身的原点"

